<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">只和过去的自己比较</text><view class="page-title">你的数据轨迹</view><view class="stats"><view class="card stat"><text>当前 BMI</text><b>{{latest.bmi || '—'}}</b><text>{{latest.bmi ? '估算值' : '待记录'}}</view><view class="card stat"><text>估算体脂</text><b>{{latest.bodyFat || '—'}}<small wx:if="{{latest.bodyFat}}">%</small></b><text>仅供趋势参考</text></view></view><view class="card insight"><text>本周打卡完成度</text><text class="score">{{completion}}%</text><text class="muted">{{note}}</text></view><text class="section-title">体重趋势</text><view class="card chart-card"><view wx:if="{{points.length}}" class="chart"><view wx:for="{{points}}" wx:key="date" class="point" style="left:{{item.left}}%;bottom:{{item.bottom}}%;"><text>{{item.weight}}</text></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">记录体重后，这里会生成你的趋势图</view></view><text class="section-title">最近 7 次身体记录</text><view class="card trend"><view wx:if="{{records.length}}" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="date" class="row"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.weight}} kg</text><text>BMI {{item.bmi}}</text></view><view wx:else class="empty">暂无身体数据</view></view><view class="card disclosure"><text>关于估算体脂率</text><text>它根据年龄、性别与 BMI 推算，适合观察变化趋势，不代表专业测量结果。</text></view></view>
